 definitive anthem of the Civil Rights Movement.\nWho is this legendary artist and the song?", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-31T03:12:51Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Aretha Franklin?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-31T03:13:02Z", "username": "Pranshu", "text": "wrong wire", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]